      "description": "You slowly open the weathered journal of Henrig Lonebrow....",
      "dialogue": {
        "023927d6f7f7a0c80c52": "From your look of concern, I can tell that something is amiss....",
        "66e5fa6763e688f98331": "You say you found this journal on a deceased dwarf? Give me but a moment to peruse the pages..."
      },
